cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "traits.use" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: "traits.use: Access and Wrangle Data from 'traits.build' Trait Databases"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: Load, explore and wrangle data from relational trait databases built with
  'traits.build', such as 'AusTraits', the Australian plant trait database. Functions
  load a database from its DOI, join data across its tables, filter it to specific
  taxa, traits or datasets, combine several databases, look up references, and visualise
  the distribution of the data. traits.use began as the 'austraits' R package.
